<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Data Generation</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .section-title { font-size: 24pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .grid-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px; }
        .grid-item { flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 15px); min-width: 350px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .item-header { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .item-details p { margin: 5px 0; }
        .footer { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 60px; right: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10pt; color: #555; }
        .logo-area { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .logo-icon { font-size: 80pt; }
        .center-title { font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; }
        .subtitle { text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px; }
        .tech-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-top: 30px; }
        .tech-item { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px; }
        .tech-item h3 { margin-top: 0; }
        .image-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .image-gallery img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
        .contact-info { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; }
        .contact-info p { margin: 5px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="logo-area">
        <div class="logo-icon">&#9889;</div> <!-- Placeholder for logo icon -->
        <div class="center-title">INNOVATION & CURIOUSITY CENTER</div>
        <div class="subtitle">C2 Pipeline is a <span data-field="c2_pipeline_affiliation">{{ c2_pipeline_affiliation }}</span> program funded as a <span data-field="c2_pipeline_funding_detail">{{ c2_pipeline_funding_detail }}</span> through the <span data-field="c2_pipeline_funding_agency">{{ c2_pipeline_funding_agency }}</span>.</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 40pt; color: #333;">CSI</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Finger Printing</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students learn about the history of fingerprinting and the methods that forensic scientists use to detect fingerprints. Students participate in a lab where they will analyze fingerprints and dust fingerprints.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="finger_printing.grade_recommendation">{{ finger_printing.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="finger_printing.time_allowed">{{ finger_printing.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="finger_printing.cost">{{ finger_printing.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Ballistics</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>In this activity, students use spent slugs found at the scene of the crime to determine the guilt or innocence of a suspect. They will learn all about ammunition and conduct a ballistics forensic ex-amination.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="ballistics.grade_recommendation">{{ ballistics.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="ballistics.time_allowed">{{ ballistics.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="ballistics.cost">{{ ballistics.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Blood Simulation</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students learn about the properties of blood and how forensic scientists conduct field tests for blood. Students test blood samples to determine blood types of suspects, the crime scene and the victim.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="blood_simulation.grade_recommendation">{{ blood_simulation.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="blood_simulation.time_allowed">{{ blood_simulation.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="blood_simulation.cost">{{ blood_simulation.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Drug Toxicology</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students learn about forensic drug toxicology and detection of drugs. They also learn about forensic toxicologists and their role in forensic science. Students participate in a drug detection lab.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="drug_toxicology.grade_recommendation">{{ drug_toxicology.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="drug_toxicology.time_allowed">{{ drug_toxicology.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="drug_toxicology.cost">{{ drug_toxicology.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Blood Spatter</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students learn about the properties of blood and how it relates to blood spatter analysis. They will complete a lab that investigates several types of blood spatter patterns.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="blood_spatter.grade_recommendation">{{ blood_spatter.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="blood_spatter.time_allowed">{{ blood_spatter.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="blood_spatter.cost">{{ blood_spatter.cost }}</span> per group</p>
                <p>Important Info: Please dress appropriately, might be messy.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Hair Analysis</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will learn about hair and how forensic scientists use samples to solve crimes. They will also learn the basics of microscope use and how to make a wet mount with their own hair!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="hair_analysis.grade_recommendation">{{ hair_analysis.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="hair_analysis.time_allowed">{{ hair_analysis.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="hair_analysis.cost">{{ hair_analysis.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div>
            <p>&#128222; 313-577-3499</p>
            <p>@c2stemlab</p>
            <p>https://c2pipeline.wayne.edu/stem-lab</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>C2 Pipeline Innovation and Curiosity Lab</p>
            <p>5000 Guillen Mall Rm. 133</p>
            <p>Detroit, MI 48202</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 40pt; color: #333;">TECHNOLOGY</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="tech-grid">
        <div class="tech-item">
            <h3>Spheros - An Intro to Java</h3>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Come learn the basics of Java Programming with the Sphero SPARK! Students will be challenged with getting their robot through a maze with multiple obstacles!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="spheros.grade_recommendation">{{ spheros.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="spheros.time_allowed">{{ spheros.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="spheros.cost">{{ spheros.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
            <h3>3D Printing</h3>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>New lab design coming soon</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
            <h3>Raspberry Pi Tops - Intro to Sonic Pi</h3>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Check out our latest addition to the STEM Lab! The Raspberry Pi Top lab exposes students to laptops that are ran completely off the Raspberry Pi. Students will learn to code in Sonic Pi, a music programming language. Coding, Raspberry Pi and music making all in one!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_tops.grade_recommendation">{{ raspberry_pi_tops.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_tops.time_allowed">{{ raspberry_pi_tops.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_tops.cost">{{ raspberry_pi_tops.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
            <h3>Raspberry Pi Racing</h3>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>The Raspberry Pi Racing lab has students reverse engineer their own car that is powered by a Raspberry Pi and remotely operated with their smart phone. Students will understand the basic parts of a car as well as the technology component that goes into modern cars. Fully equipped with a camera, sensors and servos this car is a tinkerers dream!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_racing.grade_recommendation">{{ raspberry_pi_racing.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_racing.time_allowed">{{ raspberry_pi_racing.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="raspberry_pi_racing.cost">{{ raspberry_pi_racing.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-item">
            <h3>Nintendo Switch Battle of the Bands</h3>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Who doesn't love a good Nintendo game? At the STEM Lab we are coding with the Nintendo Switch! Bring your students and have them code their own band, then compete in the battle of the bands! We have guitars, pianos, drums and more waiting for you to come code!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="nintendo_switch.grade_recommendation">{{ nintendo_switch.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="nintendo_switch.time_allowed">{{ nintendo_switch.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="nintendo_switch.cost">{{ nintendo_switch.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div>
            <p>&#128222; 313-577-3499</p>
            <p>@c2stemlab</p>
            <p>https://c2pipeline.wayne.edu/stem-lab</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>C2 Pipeline Innovation and Curiosity Lab</p>
            <p>5000 Guillen Mall Rm. 133</p>
            <p>Detroit, MI 48202</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 40pt; color: #333;">ANATOMY</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Brain Dissection</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will examine the exterior and interior areas of a sheep's brain. Students will dissect the brain and determine how the brain works.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="brain_dissection.grade_recommendation">{{ brain_dissection.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="brain_dissection.time_allowed">{{ brain_dissection.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="brain_dissection.cost">{{ brain_dissection.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Eye Dissection</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will examine the exterior and interior areas of a sheep's eye. They will dissect the eye to determine how the different parts of the eye are related to one another.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="eye_dissection.grade_recommendation">{{ eye_dissection.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="eye_dissection.time_allowed">{{ eye_dissection.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="eye_dissection.cost">{{ eye_dissection.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Heart Dissection</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will examine the exterior and interior areas of a sheep's heart. They will dissect the heart to determine how the different parts of the heart are related to one another.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="heart_dissection.grade_recommendation">{{ heart_dissection.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="heart_dissection.time_allowed">{{ heart_dissection.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="heart_dissection.cost">{{ heart_dissection.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Lung Dissection</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will examine the exterior and interior areas of a sheep's lungs. They will dissect the lungs and even get to see them in action!</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="lung_dissection.grade_recommendation">{{ lung_dissection.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="lung_dissection.time_allowed">{{ lung_dissection.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="lung_dissection.cost">{{ lung_dissection.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Fetal Pig Dissection</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>It's a classic, fetal pig dissection has made it to the lab! Students will work in groups to perform a fetal pig dissection.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="fetal_pig_dissection.grade_recommendation">{{ fetal_pig_dissection.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="fetal_pig_dissection.time_allowed">{{ fetal_pig_dissection.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="fetal_pig_dissection.cost">{{ fetal_pig_dissection.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div>
            <p>&#128222; 313-577-3499</p>
            <p>@c2stemlab</p>
            <p>https://c2pipeline.wayne.edu/stem-lab</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>C2 Pipeline Innovation and Curiosity Lab</p>
            <p>5000 Guillen Mall Rm. 133</p>
            <p>Detroit, MI 48202</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 40pt; color: #333;">SCIENCE</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Liquids and Solutions</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will learn about the physical properties of liquids and how to prepare and describe solutions.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="liquids_solutions.grade_recommendation">{{ liquids_solutions.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="liquids_solutions.time_allowed">{{ liquids_solutions.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="liquids_solutions.cost">{{ liquids_solutions.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">DNA</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Learn about DNA with two activities in one! Students will learn the art of gel electrophoresis as well as learn how to cut and match DNA strands.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="dna.grade_recommendation">{{ dna.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="dna.time_allowed">{{ dna.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="dna.cost">{{ dna.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Non-Newtonian Fluids</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will learn about the properties of Non-Newtonian fluids. Students will participate in a silly putty vs. Oobleck challenge.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="non_newtonian_fluids.grade_recommendation">{{ non_newtonian_fluids.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="non_newtonian_fluids.time_allowed">{{ non_newtonian_fluids.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="non_newtonian_fluids.cost">{{ non_newtonian_fluids.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Acids and Bases</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students learn about acids and bases. They will participate in a lab to turn water into blood and experiment with invisible ink.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="acids_bases.grade_recommendation">{{ acids_bases.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="acids_bases.time_allowed">{{ acids_bases.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="acids_bases.cost">{{ acids_bases.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-item">
            <div class="item-header">Owl Pellet Digestion</div>
            <div class="item-details">
                <p>Students will learn about food chains, food webs, transfer of energy, and ecological pyramids and succession. They will participate in an owl dissection lab.</p>
                <p>Grade Recommendation: <span data-field="owl_pellet_digestion.grade_recommendation">{{ owl_pellet_digestion.grade_recommendation }}</span></p>
                <p>Time Allowed: <span data-field="owl_pellet_digestion.time_allowed">{{ owl_pellet_digestion.time_allowed }}</span></p>
                <p>Cost: <span data-field="owl_pellet_digestion.cost">{{ owl_pellet_digestion.cost }}</span> per group</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div>
            <p>&#128222; 313-577-3499</p>
            <p>@c2stemlab</p>
            <p>https://c2pipeline.wayne.edu/stem-lab</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>C2 Pipeline Innovation and Curiosity Lab</p>
            <p>5000 Guillen Mall Rm. 133</p>
            <p>Detroit, MI 48202</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

